# HTTP security & privacy headers for eaumed.com.
# Applied automatically by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify (this file's format). GitHub Pages ignores it:
# on GitHub Pages, tick "Enforce HTTPS" and set these via a proxy (e.g. Cloudflare free tier,
# Rules > Transform Rules > Modify Response Header).
#
# Every origin below is 'self': fonts, scripts, images and the 3D model are all served from this
# site, and the site has no forms, analytics, embeds or trackers. blob: is the in-memory copy of the
# 3D model. 'unsafe-inline' covers one inline line (<script>…classList.add('js')</script>) and the
# inline style attributes of the hours chart; nothing needs 'unsafe-eval'.
# Deploy once as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only and check the console before enforcing.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'none'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'self' blob:; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
